# Mohandes Man frontend architecture

Follow this architecture for every change. Do not invent a different structure.

## Hard constraints

- Never create a `src/` directory. Routes live in `app/` at the project root.
- Never create `index.ts` or `index.tsx` barrel files.
- Pages must stay thin. Domain UI does not live in route files.
- Server Components by default. Add `"use client"` only when the file needs events, state, effects, or browser APIs.
- Do not convert `app/layout.tsx` into a Client Component. Compose client providers from `providers/`.
- Use `@/` imports. Do not use deep relative imports when an alias is clearer.
- Do not use `any`, `@ts-ignore`, or unsafe assertions unless there is a documented technical reason.
- Do not install new dependencies without a clear need.
- Do not change this architecture without explicit instruction.
- Do not add Redux, Zustand, Material UI, Ant Design, Chakra UI, or Bootstrap.
- shadcn/ui may be used for accessible primitives. Project architecture overrides shadcn’s default filesystem layout. Do not add every shadcn component. Review generated source before keeping it.
- pnpm is the only package manager.

## Folder map

- `app/` — routes, layouts, loading/error boundaries, Route Handlers
- `components/layout/` — header, footer, navigation, search shell
- `components/ui/` — design-system primitives only
- `components/common/` — reusable non-primitive, non-domain UI
- `components/store/` — all store/domain feature UI
- `hooks/` — reusable React hooks
- `lib/` — pure utilities and infrastructure
- `services/` — domain API access
- `providers/` — React providers
- `config/` — static configuration
- `types/store/` — shared domain types
- `css/` — global styles only (`css/globals.css`)

## Naming

Components: camelCase folders and files, PascalCase exports.

```text
components/store/cartDrawer/cartDrawer.tsx
components/ui/button/button.tsx
export function CartDrawer() {}
export function Button() {}
```

Hooks, lib, providers, config, and services: kebab-case folder per module.

```text
hooks/use-cart/use-cart.ts
lib/utils/cn/cn.ts
lib/api/http-client/http-client.ts
providers/query-provider/query-provider.tsx
providers/app-provider/app-provider.tsx
config/site.config/site.config.ts
services/auth-service/auth-service.ts
```

Routes: kebab-case, groups `(auth)` and `(shop)`, dynamic `[id]`.

```text
app/(auth)/sign-in/page.tsx
app/(shop)/engineers/[id]/page.tsx
```

Do not put hook files directly in `hooks/`. Do not put lib files directly in `lib/`. Do not put domain components in `components/ui/`.

## Feature UI shape

```text
components/store/<feature>/<componentName>/<componentName>.tsx
components/store/<feature>/<componentName>/type/<componentName>.types.ts
```

Colocate component types. Put shared domain types in `types/store/*.types.ts`.

## Data and env

- Read the API origin from `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL` via `lib/env/env.ts`.
- Do not hardcode API base URLs.
- Keep application-specific queries out of `providers/query-provider/`.
- Use native fetch only. Do not introduce Axios.
- Use TanStack Query only for client-side server state (refetch, mutations, polling, client cache).
- The application is Persian and RTL. Keep `lang="fa"` and `dir="rtl"` on the root document.
- Do not change this architecture unless explicitly instructed.
